Financing\n\n\nWe handle your insurance claims, start to finish\n\nFlexible financing with no hidden costs\n\nMembership plans for patients without insurance\n\n\n## Because Quality Care Should Never Be Out of Reach\n\n\nAt Livewell Dental, we believe exceptional dentistry should come with clarity, choice, and confidence—never surprise bills. From simple cleanings to full-mouth restorations, we work hard to make your treatment accessible without cutting corners on quality. Transparency is one of our core values:\n\nYou’ll always know fees upfront.\n\nNo hidden costs. No fine print.\n\nWe fight to maximize your insurance benefits on your behalf.\n\n\n## Your Options, Your Terms\n\n\nWhether it’s a single restoration or a full-mouth transformation, you’ll have a clear plan, a clear price, and a clear path forward.\n\nCash\n\nPersonal Checks\n\nVisa\n\nMastercard\n\nAmerican Express\n\nOne Patient at a Time\n\n\n## Making Premium Dentistry Fit Your Life\n\n\nEvery patient’s goals, timeline, and budget are different. That’s why we offer flexible payment solutions designed to remove barriers and keep you moving forward.\n\n\n### INSURANCE\n\n\nWe accept your dental insurance and handle all claims for you.\n\nWe follow up to make sure they’re paid—so you don’t have to.\n\nUnsure about coverage?Just call—we’ll verify it for you.\n\n\n### Financing Options\n\n\nn-House Payment Plans – Personalized, interest-free arrangements.\n\nCherry Financing\n\nApply in seconds, pay in predictable monthly installments.\n\nAlphaeon Credit\n\nExtended plans tailored for health and aesthetic care.\n\n\n### Livewell Membership\n\n\nPerfect for patients without insurance, or those tired of red tape.\n\nNo maximums, deductibles, or pre-approvals\n\nImmediate eligibility\n\nExclusive savings on cosmetic and restorative treatments\n\n\n## Ready to Experience the Livewell Difference?\n\n\nLet’s start with a conversation.\n\nWe welcome patients who value doing things right the first time—with intention, purpose, and partnership. If you’ve been looking for something different, this is it.\n\nSchedule Your Consultation\n\nCall Us\n\nDo you accept dental insurance?\n\nYes. We accept most dental insurance plans and can help verify your benefits before treatment.\n\nWill you check my insurance benefits for me?\n\nYes. Our team can review your coverage, estimate your benefits, and explain what your plan may contribute.\n\nWill I know the cost before treatment begins?\n\nYes. We believe in clear pricing, so you will receive a treatment estimate before moving forward.\n\nDo you offer payment plans?\n\nYes. We offer flexible financing options, including in-house payment plans and third-party financing when available.\n\nWhat financing options do you work with?\n\nLivewell Dental works with options such as Cherry Financing, Alphaeon Credit, and One Patient at a Time.\n\nDo you have options for patients without insurance?\n\nYes. The Livewell Membership is designed for patients without dental insurance or those who prefer a simpler alternative.\n\nCan I use financing for cosmetic or implant treatment?\n\nYes. Financing may be used for many cosmetic, restorative, and implant treatments, depending on approval and the treatment plan.\n\nWhat payment methods do you accept?\n\nWe accept cash, personal checks, Visa, Mastercard, American Express, Discover, and One Patient at a Time.\n\n\n### Frequently Asked Questions\n\n\nContact Us\n\n\n### Reimagine your dental experience\n\n\n\n### address\n\n\n9027 Silverbrook Rd Ste. F\n\nFairfax Station, VA 22039\n\n\n### Contact\n\n\n\n### Hours\n\n\nMon-Tue: 8am-5pm\n\nWed-Thu: 8am-4pm\n\nFri: 8am-1pm\n\n\n### Connect\n\n\nServing Fairfax Station and the Greater Northern Virginia Area\n\nCopyright © TEXT-YEAR Livewell Dental\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nTerms of Service\n\nCookie Policy\n\nHIPAA Disclosure\n\nConsent Preferences",
